    "detailed_description": "Ocean Tower of the Keepers is drowning in blood. Sea creatures have burst into the sanctum, slaughtering all Keepers... except you. <br />\r\n<br />\r\nArmed with an arsenal of battle wizardry, you'll need more than wit to fend off the hordes. Dive into this roguelike adventure as a battle mage, unlocking powerful staffs each granting unique spells. Discover and harness artifacts that amplify your strength, while the tower\u2019s corridors echo with screams. Can you, the last Keeper, reclaim the sanctum and keep lands of mankind from evil, or will you end up as fish food?",
